#: source/package-management/sharing-packages.md:1
msgid "Sharing Packages Between Machines"
msgstr ""

#: source/package-management/sharing-packages.md:3
msgid ""
"Sometimes you want to copy a package from one machine to another. Or, you "
"want to install some packages and you know that another machine already has "
"some or all of those packages or their dependencies. In that case there are "
"mechanisms to quickly copy packages between machines."
msgstr ""
